{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.poster.avif?t=1764594905\" width=1170 height=367 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.webm?t=1764594905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.avif?t=1764594905\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras_big/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.webp?t=1764594905 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congratulations \u2014 you\u2019ve been accepted for a probationary period!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blueman is looking for motivated interns willing to do anything: set up workstations, feed the demon, make others work, and join corporate games without asking too many questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During probation you\u2019ll climb floor by floor: on each floor a new \u201cimportant task\u201d awaits \u2014 and for some reason it\u2019s entrusted to you. Clear every trial and, who knows, one day you might be the one giving the orders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A do-it-all intern.</strong> You play the person everything gets dumped on, from \u201clittle errands\u201d to tasks that somehow decide an entire department\u2019s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No monotonous grind.</strong> Each level plays like a standalone mini-game with its own rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Probation with no room for mistakes.</strong> Mistakes restart the current level, making attention to detail central to the gameplay \u2014 just like a real probation where perfection is expected and almost nothing is explained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hell suspiciously similar to work.</strong> Beneath the gloom and demons lurk very familiar office realities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short yet substantial.</strong> The compact format lets you experience the whole intern journey \u2014 from the first task to the top floor \u2014 in a single sitting.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3135260?t=1764594905","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/b861da316afded728e8163a0229423fd029911a6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764594905","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/baa732f89939e68b19a90f1d472937b889a884ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764594905","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/baa732f89939e68b19a90f1d472937b889a884ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764594905","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blueman is an office worker simulator set in a demonic corporation. The game may contain non-realistic violence involving demonic entities without the depiction of blood."},"demos":[{"appid":3987210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.poster.avif?t=1764594905\" width=1170 height=367 ><source src=\"https://shared.a